Sphere of Ultimate Destruction	TYPE:Arcane	SCHOOL:Conjuration	SUBSCHOOL:Creation	COMPS:V, S, M	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Medium	TARGETAREA:1-foot-radius sphere	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) rounds [D]	SAVEINFO:Fortitude partial (see text)	SPELLRES:Yes	CLASSES:Sorcerer,Wizard=9	DESC:Conjure a black sphere of nothingness that disintegrates almost anything it touches.	SOURCEPAGE:p.52
