###Block: Descriptions
Abolish Shadows.MOD	DESC:Shadow creatures take ((CASTERLEVEL)MIN10)d6 damage. May dispell shadow or darkness spells.
Animate Dread Warrior.MOD	DESC:You transform the corpse of a skilled warrior into an undead monster under your command.
Beltyn's Burning Blood.MOD	DESC:You deal 1d8 pts of acid and 1d8 pts of fire damage per round.
Bladebane.MOD	DESC:Add +2 enhancement and +2d6 pts of damage to slashing weapon against a creature type of your choice.
Decastave.MOD	DESC:Deals 1d6 damage per hit. Critical deals 1d8 bonus sonic damage.
Force Orb.MOD	DESC:Orbs of force that deal ((CASTERLEVEL)MIN10)d6 of damage.
Ghorus Toth's Magnetism.MOD	DESC:Target is charged with magnetic force that attracts all metal within 30 ft.
Greenfire.MOD	DESC:Green energy deals 2d6 + ((CASTERLEVEL)MIN10) pts of acid damage.
Ilyykur's Mantle.MOD	DESC:((CASTERLEVEL/3)MIN5) on saving throws vs. spells/spell-like abilities and electricity resistance 10.
Recitation (UE).MOD	DESC:Allies gain +2 on attacks and saves, +3 if they worship same deity. Foes lose -2 on attacks and saves.
Sinsabur's Baleful Bolt.MOD	DESC:Bolt of dark energy deals 1d3 + ((CASTERLEVEL/4)MIN3) pts of temporary Strength and Constitution damage
Snilloc's Snowball.MOD	DESC:One snowball deals 1d6 + ((CASTERLEVEL)MIN5) cold damage.
Soul Scour.MOD	DESC:Deals 2d6 temp Charisma and 1d6 temp Wisdom damage immediately and 1d6 temp Charisma damage 1 minute later.
Superior Darkvision.MOD	DESC:Gains darkvision with no limit on range of vision.
Watchware.MOD	DESC:Create a mystical connection with a single object that lets you know if it is disturbed in any way.

